rem Prime Cube Partnership
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=131
rem Count the primes p below a limit for
rem which n^3 + n^2 p is a perfect cube

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Limit integer = 1000000

rem Only p = (k + 1)^3 - k^3 works,
rem with n = k^3 and m = k^2 (k + 1).
Top = (Limit // 3) isqrt + 1
K = 1 to Top array
P' = 3 * K * K + 3 * K + 1
Small' = P less Limit
Cand' = P filter Small array
Answer = (Cand in primes) count
Answer print
